  CoachLines:
  - Speaker: 4
    WhenLeak: 1
    RequireBufferKid: 0
    RequireBroke: 0
    RequireFuelMiss: 0
    Line: Grab is not a bus. Your pocket noticed.
  - Speaker: 1
    WhenLeak: 2
    RequireBufferKid: 0
    RequireBroke: 0
    RequireFuelMiss: 0
    Line: Gong Cha can wait. Recess already fed you.
  - Speaker: 1
    WhenLeak: 3
    RequireBufferKid: 0
    RequireBroke: 0
    RequireFuelMiss: 0
    Line: Canteen food is cheaper than going hungry all morning.
  - Speaker: 4
    WhenLeak: 0
    RequireBufferKid: 1
    RequireBroke: 0
    RequireFuelMiss: 0
    Line: Keep that $2. Something always comes up after school.
  - Speaker: 4
    WhenLeak: 0
    RequireBufferKid: 0
    RequireBroke: 1
    RequireFuelMiss: 0
    Line: Empty pocket before the last bell. Next Monday, lock a buffer first.
  - Speaker: 4
    WhenLeak: 0
    RequireBufferKid: 0
    RequireBroke: 0
    RequireFuelMiss: 1
    Line: You got through, but you were running on fumes.
  - Speaker: 4
    WhenLeak: 0
    RequireBufferKid: 0
    RequireBroke: 0
    RequireFuelMiss: 0
